 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "RangeIterator(start, end, step) with step != 0 iterates start, start + step, start + 2*step, ... while the value is strictly below end (positive step) or strictly above end (negative step). hasNext() returns whether another value remains. next() returns the next value and advances; it is only called when hasNext() would return true.",
  "provenance": [
